> (hunger killed me about 1/4 of the games) and I'm constantly healthy.
> The only limitation seems to be the inventory.  What am I doing wrong?
> Am I exploring too much or too slowly? (I think I'm xp-lvl:10 dlvl:10)

Sounds like you're doing well.  Valks can often roll over things at this
point in the game.  You may want to double back and explore the other
branch, go find Minetown (sounds like you've got goodies you want to
ID), explore a little.  Do Sokoban (a BOH or "oReflection at the top,
and lots of food -- you don't need it now, but may later, or for taming
purposes).


